[00:13.00]We've only just begun to live
[00:13.00:zh]我们的生活刚刚开始
[00:22.00]White lace and promises
[00:22.00:zh]神圣婚礼中许下山盟海誓
[00:27.00]A kiss for luck and we're on our way
[00:27.00:zh]相互幸运一吻过后我们就奔向幸福的日子
[00:32.00]We've only begun
[00:32.00:zh]一切才刚刚启程
[00:35.00]Before all the rising sun we fly
[00:35.00:zh]在旭日完全升起之前，我们就扬帆起航了
[00:44.00]So many roads to choose
[00:44.00:zh]如此多条路可供选择
[00:49.00]We start our walking and learn to run
[00:49.00:zh]我们迈开步伐学着跑起来
[00:55.00]And yes we've just begun
[00:55.00:zh]是的我们只是才开始
[01:03.00]Sharing horizons that are new to us
[01:03.00:zh]共赴属于我们的全新光景
[01:08.00]Watching the signs along the way
[01:08.00:zh]望着沿路一个又一个的路标
[01:14.00]Talking it over just the two of us
[01:14.00:zh]促膝长谈只有我们两人
[01:19.00]Working together day to day
[01:19.00:zh]日复一日一起辛勤劳作
[01:24.00]Together
[01:24.00:zh]相伴相依
[01:28.00]And when the evening comes we smile
[01:28.00:zh]当夜晚降临我们展露笑容
[01:37.00]So much of life ahead
[01:37.00:zh]前方生活如此丰富多彩
[01:42.00]We'll find a place where there's room to grow
[01:42.00:zh]我们会寻一处天地，慢慢经营生活
[01:47.00]And yes we've just begun
[01:47.00:zh]是的我们只是才开始
